<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>OSP Training — Launch Fiber Services</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
<style>
:root{
  --primary:#1B5FA0;--primary-dark:#134880;--primary-light:#E8F0FB;
  --bg:#FAFAFA;--panel:#FFFFFF;--border:#E5E7EB;
  --text:#1F2937;--text-muted:#6B7280;
  --font:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;
}
html[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#111827;--panel:#1F2937;--border:#374151;
  --text:#F9FAFB;--text-muted:#9CA3AF;--primary-light:#1E3A5C;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{
  font-family:var(--font);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
  min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
}
.topbar{
  background:#003F72;color:#fff;height:84px;display:flex;align-items:center;
  padding:0 20px;gap:12px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
  position:relative;
}
.topbar img{
  height:60px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;display:block;
  position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);pointer-events:none;
  filter:brightness(0) invert(1) opacity(0.95);
}
.topbar-spacer{flex:1}
.back-btn{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:#fff;
  padding:8px 14px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;font-family:inherit;
  cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;text-decoration:none;
}
.back-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.22)}
.main{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px 20px}
.card{
  background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;
  padding:48px 40px;max-width:560px;width:100%;text-align:center;
  box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
}
.card i.fa-graduation-cap{font-size:64px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:20px;display:block}
.card h1{font-size:26px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px}
.card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:8px}
.card .small{font-size:12px;margin-top:18px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <a href="/" class="back-btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Portals</a>
  <img src="/img/launch-fiber-logo-transparent.png" alt="Launch Fiber Services">
  <div class="topbar-spacer"></div>
</div>

<div class="main">
  <div class="card">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i>
    <h1>OSP Training</h1>
    <p>The training portal is being merged in from a sibling project. When it's live, you'll find modules covering ribbon vs loose-tube construction, ring cuts, TIA-598 color codes, and field-design practice exercises.</p>
    <p class="small">Coming soon — check back after the next deploy.</p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
